#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:4
msgid ":index:`Status Icons <icons; status>`"
msgstr ":index:`状态图标 <icons; status>`"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:6
msgid "When albums and tracks are displayed in the right-hand pane, each line begins with an icon to indicate the status of the item."
msgstr "当专辑和音轨在右侧窗格中显示时，每一行都以一个图标开头，以指示项目的状态。"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:9
msgid ":index:`Album / Release Icons <icons; album, icons; release>`"
msgstr ":index:`专辑 / 发行品图标 <icons; album, icons; release>`"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:15
msgid "|img-release|"
msgstr "|img-release|"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:11
msgid "img-release"
msgstr "img-release"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:0
msgid "This icon indicates that the information for the release has been successfully retrieved from the MusicBrainz database. Some, but not all, tracks may have been matched to files and the information has not been modified."
msgstr ""
"此图标表示发行品的信息已成功从 MusicBrainz 数据库中检索。部分，但非全部，音轨"
"可能已匹配到文件，且信息未被修改。"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:24
msgid "|img-release-modified|"
msgstr "|img-release-modified|"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:20
msgid "img-release-modified"
msgstr "img-release-modified"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:0
msgid "This icon indicates that some of the tracks have been matched and that the information for the release has been modified."
msgstr "此图标表示部分音轨已匹配，且发行品的信息已被修改。"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:33
msgid "|img-release-matched|"
msgstr "|img-release-matched|"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:29
msgid "img-release-matched"
msgstr "img-release-matched"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:0
msgid "This icon indicates that all of the tracks have been matched and that the information has not been modified."
msgstr "此图标表示所有音轨已匹配，且发行品的信息未被修改。"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:42
msgid "|img-release-matched-modified|"
msgstr "|img-release-matched-modified|"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:38
msgid "img-release-matched-modified"
msgstr "img-release-matched-modified"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:0
msgid "This icon indicates that all of the tracks have been matched and that the information for the release has been modified."
msgstr "此图标表示所有音轨已匹配，且发行品的信息已被修改。"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:51
msgid "|img-release-error|"
msgstr "|img-release-error|"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:47
msgid "img-release-error"
msgstr "img-release-error"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:0
msgid "This icon indicates that Picard has encountered an error with the release, typically while retrieving the information from the MusicBrainz database."
msgstr ""
"此图标表示 Picard 在处理发行品时遇到错误，通常是在从 MusicBrainz 数据库检索信"
"息时。"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:58
msgid ":index:`Track Icons <icons; track>`"
msgstr ":index:`音轨图标 <icons; track>`"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:64
msgid "|img-track-audio|"
msgstr "|img-track-audio|"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:60
msgid "img-track-audio"
msgstr "img-track-audio"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:0
msgid "This icon indicates that the track is an audio track and that there is no single file currently matched. This appears if there is no file matched, or if there are multiple files matched."
msgstr ""
"此图标表示音轨是音频音轨，且当前没有单个文件匹配。如果没有任何文件匹配，或有"
"多文件匹配时会出现。"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:73
msgid "|img-track-video|"
msgstr "|img-track-video|"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:69
msgid "img-track-video"
msgstr "img-track-video"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:0
msgid "This icon indicates that the track is a video track and that there is no file currently matched. This appears if there is no file matched, or if there are multiple files matched."
msgstr ""
"此图标表示音轨是视频音轨，且当前没有文件匹配。如果没有任何文件匹配，或有多文"
"件匹配时会出现。"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:82
msgid "|img-track-data|"
msgstr "|img-track-data|"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:78
msgid "img-track-data"
msgstr "img-track-data"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:0
msgid "This icon indicates that the track is a data track and that there is no file currently matched. This appears if there is no file matched, or if there are multiple files matched."
msgstr ""
"此图标表示音轨是数据音轨，且当前没有文件匹配。如果没有任何文件匹配，或有多文"
"件匹配时会出现。"

