#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:0
msgid "These icons indicates the quality of match between the information from the file and the information for the track as provided from the MusicBrainz database. Red indicates a poor match, progressing to all green which indicates a very good match. Note that the icons will be displayed dimmed if there is a pending action for the track, such as the file being queued for saving."
msgstr ""
"这些图标表示文件信息与 MusicBrainz 数据库提供的音轨信息之间的匹配质量。红色表"
"示匹配较差，逐渐变为所有绿色表示匹配非常好。请注意，如果音轨有待处理操作（例"
"如文件正在排队保存），图标会显示为暗淡。"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:146
msgid "|img-track-saved|"
msgstr "|img-track-saved|"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:142
msgid "img-track-saved"
msgstr "img-track-saved"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:0
msgid "This icon indicates that the track has been saved successfully."
msgstr "此图标表示音轨已成功保存。"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:155
msgid "|img-error-no-access|"
msgstr "|img-error-no-access|"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:151
msgid "img-error-no-access"
msgstr "img-error-no-access"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:0
msgid "This icon indicates that Picard encountered a permission error while trying to load or save the file. This is typically due to the file being marked as read-only, or you do not have sufficient permission to read the file or save the file in the specified directory."
msgstr ""
"此图标表示 Picard 在尝试加载或保存文件时遇到了权限错误。这通常是由于文件被标"
"记为只读，或者您没有足够的权限读取文件或在指定目录中保存文件。"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:164
msgid "|img-error-not-found|"
msgstr "|img-error-not-found|"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:160
msgid "img-error-not-found"
msgstr "img-error-not-found"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:0
msgid "This icon indicates that Picard could not find the file with the given path while trying to load or save the track. This is typically due to the file being moved or deleted since it was loaded into Picard, but could also be due to a missing directory."
msgstr ""
"此图标表示 Picard 在尝试加载或保存音轨时找不到给定路径的文件。这通常是由于文"
"件在加载到 Picard 后被移动或删除，但也可能是由于目录丢失。"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:173
msgid "|img-dialog-error|"
msgstr "|img-dialog-error|"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:169
msgid "img-dialog-error"
msgstr "img-dialog-error"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:175
msgid "This icon indicates that Picard encountered an error while trying to load or save the track. This is typically due to a problem writing the tags into the file, but could also be due to a storage IO error on your system."
msgstr ""
"此图标表示 Picard 在尝试加载或保存音轨时遇到了错误。这通常是由于将标签写入文"
"件时出现问题，但也可能是由于系统上的存储 IO 错误。"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:179
msgid ":index:`Status Bar <icons; status bar, status bar>`"
msgstr ":index:`状态栏 <icons; status bar, status bar>`"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:181
msgid "There is a status bar at the bottom of Picard's main screen, which displays some information about current processing status. This includes four numbers along with the current port number that Picard is monitoring, and a notification icon if there are any plugin updates available. In addition, if Picard is currently processing your files an estimated time to completion will also be displayed to the left of the status indicators."
msgstr ""
"Picard 的主屏幕底部有一个状态栏，它显示一些当前处理状态的信息。这包括四个数字"
"以及 Picard 当前正在监控的端口号，如果有可用的插件更新，还会显示一个通知图标"
"。此外，如果 Picard 当前正在处理您的文件，状态指示器左侧还会显示预计完成时间"
"。"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:186
msgid "From left to right, the numbers represent:"
msgstr "从左到右，数字代表："

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:188
msgid "The estimated processing time remaining (only displayed if Picard is actively processing files)."
msgstr "剩余的估计处理时间（仅当 Picard 正在积极处理文件时显示）。"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:189
msgid "The number of files loaded."
msgstr "已加载的文件数量。"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:190
msgid "The number of MusicBrainz releases loaded."
msgstr "已加载的 MusicBrainz 发行品数量。"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:191
msgid "The number of files with pending action (e.g. loading, saving, fingerprinting)."
msgstr "有待处理操作的文件数量（例如加载、保存、指纹识别）。"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:192
msgid "The number of active network requests."
msgstr "活跃的网络请求数量。"

#: ../../getting_started/status_icons.rst:194
msgid "If there are any plugin updates available and the notification icon is displayed, clicking the icon will open the Plugins options page where you can review the available plugin updates and select which ones to install."
msgstr ""
"如果有可用的插件更新并且通知图标显示，点击图标将打开插件选项页面，您可以在其"
"中查看可用的插件更新并选择要安装的插件。"
